<h1 style="margin:0 0 12px 0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:600;color:#0A0A0A;">Benvenuto in Rocket</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 24px 0;">Ti abbiamo creato un account su Rocket. Per il primo accesso usa queste credenziali:</p>
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#FAF7F2" style="background-color:#FAF7F2;border:1px solid #E7E1D8;border-radius:10px;">
<tr>
<td style="padding:16px 20px 8px 20px;font-size:12px;color:#817B78;">Email</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding:0 20px 16px 20px;font-size:15px;font-weight:500;color:#0A0A0A;">{username}</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding:0 20px 8px 20px;font-size:12px;color:#817B78;">Password temporanea</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding:0 20px 16px 20px;font-family:'Geist Mono',ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:17px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.04em;color:#0A0A0A;">{####}</td>
</tr>
</table>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:28px 0 24px 0;">
<tr>
<td class="rk-btn" ${button_cell}>
<a href="${login_url}" style="display:inline-block;padding:10px 20px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration:none;border-radius:8px;">Accedi a Rocket</a>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:14px;color:#817B78;">La password temporanea vale ${password_validity_days} giorni. Al primo accesso ti chiederemo di sceglierne una nuova.</p>
